    Check that ``Q`` is orthonormal:

    >>> jnp.allclose(Q.T @ Q, jnp.eye(3), atol=1E-5)
    Array(True, dtype=bool)

    Reconstruct the input:

    >>> jnp.allclose(Q @ R, a)
    Array(True, dtype=bool)

