        where K = min(M, N).

    pivoting: Allows the QR decomposition to be rank-revealing. If ``True``, compute
      the column-pivoted decomposition ``A[:, P] = Q @ R``, where ``P`` is chosen such
      that the diagonal of ``R`` is non-increasing.
